==Battleground==
*1 [[Zomboe]] spawns.
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*5 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Zigge]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A fairly easy stage since the zombie enemies are only at 20% magnification. Bring a couple of ranged attackers such as [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon]] and [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris]]. [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|Anti-Zombie]] units such as [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Wushu]] are also useful there.


